      "content": "That desire to leave a scene of ruin before it changes too much is a very understandable urge when facing immense pain. However, your current feeling of complete absence doesn't mean there is no potential for change or growth moving forward. Sometimes, simply allowing yourself to feel the reality of the decay, with support, is the first step toward finding a new foundation. Please consider connecting with a crisis line to talk through this urge to withdraw.",
