      "content": "It sounds like you are in deep despair, where the idea of any future or foundation feels completely unreal. While the feeling of needing to regain control through ending the pain is powerful, please know that ending your life is not escaping the pain, but rather ending the possibility of relief. There are people who want to help you find a different kind of peaceful exit from this suffering, not one that involves permanent loss. Please reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline immediately for immediate, non-judgmental support.",
